+        /* vcpkg: an isolated sub-interpreter refuses the single-phase _datetime (see
+           create_builtin), so datetime there is _pydatetime, which has no C API. Say so as
+           an ImportError, which zoneinfo answers by using its pure-Python ZoneInfo. */
+        if (PyErr_ExceptionMatches(PyExc_AttributeError)) {
